<td id="S5.T1.2.9.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb"><span id="S5.T1.2.9.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">DeBERTa-v3 + Fuzzy ASP (0.9)</span></td>
<td id="S5.T1.2.9.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">0.296</td>
